{"seq":3,"slug":"one-click-payment","title":"一键支付与快捷结账","url":"/l-doc-books/h/ecommerce/ecommerce-payments/checkout-optimization/one-click-payment","wordCount":1437,"readingTime":6,"html":"<h1 id=\"一键支付与快捷结账\">一键支付与快捷结账</h1><h2 id=\"核心概念\">核心概念</h2><p>一键支付（One-Click Payment）让老用户跳过繁琐的结账流程，用单次点击或生物识别完成购买。从 Amazon 的 1-Click 专利（2017 年到期）到 Apple Pay 的 Face ID 确认，快捷结账已成为提升转化率和用户体验的标配能力。其核心是将用户的支付方式、配送地址等信息安全存储后复用。</p>\n<pre class=\"mermaid\" data-diagram-type=\"graph\" data-source=\"graph LR&#10;    subgraph 传统结账&#10;        A1[选商品] --&gt; A2[填地址]&#10;        A2 --&gt; A3[选配送]&#10;        A3 --&gt; A4[填卡号]&#10;        A4 --&gt; A5[确认]&#10;        A5 --&gt; A6[完成]&#10;    end&#10;    subgraph 一键支付&#10;        B1[选商品] --&gt; B2[确认/生物识别]&#10;        B2 --&gt; B3[完成]&#10;    end\">graph LR\n    subgraph 传统结账\n        A1[选商品] --&gt; A2[填地址]\n        A2 --&gt; A3[选配送]\n        A3 --&gt; A4[填卡号]\n        A4 --&gt; A5[确认]\n        A5 --&gt; A6[完成]\n    end\n    subgraph 一键支付\n        B1[选商品] --&gt; B2[确认/生物识别]\n        B2 --&gt; B3[完成]\n    end</pre><table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>快捷支付类型</th>\n<th>代表产品</th>\n<th>存储位置</th>\n<th>认证方式</th>\n<th>转化率提升</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>平台一键支付</td>\n<td>Amazon 1-Click</td>\n<td>平台账户</td>\n<td>密码/OTP</td>\n<td>+10-15%</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>设备钱包</td>\n<td>Apple Pay/Google Pay</td>\n<td>设备安全芯片</td>\n<td>Face ID/指纹</td>\n<td>+15-25%</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>网关存储</td>\n<td>Stripe Link、Bolt</td>\n<td>网关账户</td>\n<td>邮箱+OTP</td>\n<td>+10-20%</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>超级应用</td>\n<td>微信小程序支付</td>\n<td>应用账户</td>\n<td>免密/指纹</td>\n<td>+20-30%</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<h2 id=\"支付信息令牌化存储\">支付信息令牌化存储</h2><p>一键支付的基础是安全地存储用户的支付方式。平台不应直接存储卡号，而是通过支付网关获取令牌（Token），后续交易使用令牌代替真实卡号。用户侧展示卡号后四位和卡品牌，让用户能识别和管理已绑定的支付方式。</p>\n<p>令牌的生命周期管理包括：创建（用户首次绑定时生成）、更新（卡过期或换卡时通过 Account Updater 自动更新）、删除（用户主动解绑或风控触发）、验证（定期发起 $0 授权验证令牌有效性）。</p>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"typescript\" data-code=\"interface StoredPaymentMethod {&#10;  id: string;&#10;  type: &#39;card&#39; | &#39;bank_account&#39; | &#39;wallet&#39;;&#10;  token: string;&#10;  displayName: string;&#10;  lastFourDigits: string;&#10;  brand: &#39;visa&#39; | &#39;mastercard&#39; | &#39;amex&#39;;&#10;  expiryMonth: number;&#10;  expiryYear: number;&#10;  isDefault: boolean;&#10;  billingAddress: Address;&#10;  createdAt: number;&#10;  lastUsedAt: number;&#10;  validationStatus: &#39;valid&#39; | &#39;expired&#39; | &#39;needs_update&#39;;&#10;}&#10;&#10;interface PaymentMethodManager {&#10;  list(customerId: string): Promise&lt;StoredPaymentMethod[]&gt;;&#10;  add(customerId: string, token: string): Promise&lt;StoredPaymentMethod&gt;;&#10;  setDefault(customerId: string, methodId: string): Promise&lt;void&gt;;&#10;  remove(customerId: string, methodId: string): Promise&lt;void&gt;;&#10;  validateAll(customerId: string): Promise&lt;ValidationResult[]&gt;;&#10;}\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">interface</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> StoredPaymentMethod</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">  id</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">:</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> string</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">  type</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">:</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> 'card'</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> |</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> 'bank_account'</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> |</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> 'wallet'</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">  token</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">:</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> string</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">  displayName</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">:</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> string</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">  lastFourDigits</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">:</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> string</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">  brand</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">:</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> 'visa'</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> |</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> 'mastercard'</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> |</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> 'amex'</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">  expiryMonth</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">:</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> number</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">  expiryYear</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">:</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> number</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">  isDefault</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">:</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> boolean</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">  billingAddress</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">:</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> Address</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">  createdAt</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">:</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> number</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">  lastUsedAt</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">:</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> number</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">  validationStatus</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">:</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> 'valid'</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> |</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> 'expired'</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> |</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> 'needs_update'</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">}</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">interface</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> PaymentMethodManager</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">  list</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(</span><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">customerId</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">:</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> string</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">)</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">:</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> Promise</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">&#x3C;</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">StoredPaymentMethod</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">[]>;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">  add</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(</span><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">customerId</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">:</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> string</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, </span><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">token</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">:</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> string</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">)</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">:</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> Promise</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">&#x3C;</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">StoredPaymentMethod</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">>;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">  setDefault</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(</span><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">customerId</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">:</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> string</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, </span><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">methodId</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">:</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> string</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">)</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">:</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> Promise</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">&#x3C;</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">void</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">>;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">  remove</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(</span><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">customerId</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">:</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> string</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, </span><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">methodId</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">:</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> string</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">)</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">:</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> Promise</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">&#x3C;</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">void</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">>;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">  validateAll</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(</span><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">customerId</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">:</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> string</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">)</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">:</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> Promise</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">&#x3C;</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">ValidationResult</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">[]>;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">}</span></span></code></pre></div><p>Account Updater 是卡组织提供的自动化卡号更新服务。当发卡行重新发行卡片（换卡、到期续卡）时，Account Updater 自动将新卡号同步给商户/网关，避免用户因卡片更新而需要重新绑定。Visa Account Updater（VAU）和 Mastercard Automatic Billing Updater（ABU）覆盖了全球大部分发卡行。</p>\n<h2 id=\"apple-pay-与-google-pay-集成\">Apple Pay 与 Google Pay 集成</h2><p>Apple Pay 和 Google Pay 是移动端一键支付的最佳实践，通过 W3C Payment Request API 或原生 SDK 集成。用户无需注册商户账户或填写任何表单，直接使用设备中已绑定的支付方式和地址。</p>\n<p>Payment Request API 的集成流程：检查支持性（<code>canMakePayment()</code>）→ 创建支付请求 → 用户授权（Face ID/指纹）→ 获取支付凭证 → 发送至服务端处理。</p>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"typescript\" data-code=\"interface PaymentRequestConfig {&#10;  supportedMethods: {&#10;    applePay: {&#10;      version: number;&#10;      merchantId: string;&#10;      merchantCapabilities: (&#39;supports3DS&#39; | &#39;supportsCredit&#39; | &#39;supportsDebit&#39;)[];&#10;      supportedNetworks: (&#39;visa&#39; | &#39;mastercard&#39; | &#39;amex&#39;)[];&#10;    };&#10;    googlePay: {&#10;      apiVersion: number;&#10;      apiVersionMinor: number;&#10;      allowedPaymentMethods: {&#10;        type: &#39;CARD&#39;;&#10;        parameters: {&#10;          allowedAuthMethods: (&#39;PAN_ONLY&#39; | &#39;CRYPTOGRAM_3DS&#39;)[];&#10;          allowedCardNetworks: string[];&#10;        };&#10;        tokenizationSpecification: {&#10;          type: &#39;PAYMENT_GATEWAY&#39;;&#10;          parameters: {&#10;            gateway: string;&#10;            gatewayMerchantId: string;&#10;          };&#10;        };&#10;      }[];&#10;    };&#10;  };&#10;  paymentDetails: {&#10;    total: { label: string; amount: string };&#10;    displayItems: { label: string; amount: string }[];&#10;  };&#10;  options: {&#10;    requestShipping: boolean;&#10;    requestPayerEmail: boolean;&#10;    requestPayerPhone: boolean;&#10;  };&#10;}\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">interface</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> PaymentRequestConfig</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">  supportedMethods</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">:</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">    applePay</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">:</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">      version</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">:</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> number</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">      merchantId</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">:</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> string</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">      merchantCapabilities</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">:</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4