s</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">:</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> number</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">    onFinalFailure</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">:</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> 'cancel'</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> |</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> 'pause'</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> |</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> 'downgrade'</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">    notifyCustomer</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">:</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> boolean</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  };</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">}</span></span></code></pre></div><p>催收管理（Dunning Management）处理订阅扣款失败的场景。信用卡扣款失败率约 5-10%，常见原因包括余额不足、卡过期和发卡行风控。催收策略通常是：首次失败后立即重试 → 24小时后第二次重试 → 3天后第三次重试 → 进入宽限期并通知用户更新支付方式。</p>\n<table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>催收阶段</th>\n<th>时间</th>\n<th>动作</th>\n<th>用户通知</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>智能重试</td>\n<td>立即</td>\n<td>选择最佳重试时间</td>\n<td>无</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>第二次重试</td>\n<td>+24h</td>\n<td>更换备用支付方式</td>\n<td>邮件提醒</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>第三次重试</td>\n<td>+72h</td>\n<td>再次尝试原方式</td>\n<td>短信+邮件</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>宽限期</td>\n<td>+7d</td>\n<td>暂停服务功能</td>\n<td>紧急通知</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>最终处理</td>\n<td>+14d</td>\n<td>取消/降级订阅</td>\n<td>确认通知</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<p>智能重试（Smart Retry）根据历史数据选择最优的重试时间和方式。月初和发薪日后的扣款成功率通常更高；如果用户绑定了多张卡，可以尝试备用卡。Stripe 的 Smart Retries 功能据称可以将扣款恢复率提升 11%。</p>\n<h2 id=\"安全与合规约束\">安全与合规约束</h2><p>一键支付在提升便利性的同时引入了额外的安全风险。PSD2/SCA 要求在线支付必须通过强客户认证，但对以下场景给予豁免：商户发起的交易（MIT）——即订阅续费等由商户发起而非用户发起的交易，以及金额低于 30 欧元的低价值交易。</p>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"typescript\" data-code=\"interface MITExemptionRequest {&#10;  type: &#39;recurring&#39; | &#39;installment&#39; | &#39;resubmission&#39; | &#39;reauthorization&#39; | &#39;no_show&#39;;&#10;  initialTransactionId: string;&#10;  initialScaDate: string;&#10;  subsequentReason: string;&#10;  networkTransactionId?: string;&#10;}&#10;&#10;const ONE_CLICK_SECURITY_RULES = {&#10;  requireScaOnFirstPayment: true,&#10;  mitExemptionForRecurring: true,&#10;  maxOneClickWithoutReauth: 30,&#10;  deviceBindingRequired: true,&#10;  riskThresholdForStepUp: 0.7,&#10;  biometricPreferred: true,&#10;} as const;\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">interface</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> MITExemptionRequest</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">  type</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">:</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> 'recurring'</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> |</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> 'installment'</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> |</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> 'resubmission'</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> |</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> 'reauthorization'</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> |</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> 'no_show'</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">  initialTransactionId</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">:</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> string</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">  initialScaDate</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">:</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> string</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">  subsequentReason</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">:</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> string</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">  networkTransactionId</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">?:</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> string</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">}</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">const</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> ONE_CLICK_SECURITY_RULES</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> =</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  requireScaOnFirstPayment: </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">true</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  mitExemptionForRecurring: </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">true</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  maxOneClickWithoutReauth: </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">30</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  deviceBindingRequired: </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">true</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  riskThresholdForStepUp: </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">0.7</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  biometricPreferred: </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">true</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">} </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">as</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> const</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">;</span></span></code></pre></div><table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>安全措施</th>\n<th>目的</th>\n<th>对用户体验的影响</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>首次绑卡 SCA</td>\n<td>验证持卡人身份</td>\n<td>一次性摩擦</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>MIT 豁免</td>\n<td>订阅续费免认证</td>\n<td>无感知</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>设备绑定</td>\n<td>限制支付设备范围</td>\n<td>新设备需重新验证</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>交易限额</td>\n<td>控制单笔风险</td>\n<td>大额需再验证</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>异常检测</td>\n<td>识别盗用行为</td>\n<td>风险时触发验证</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<h2 id=\"小结\">小结</h2><ul>\n<li>一键支付通过令牌化存储 + 简化认证将结账从 5-6 步缩短至 1 步，转化率提升 10-25%</li>\n<li>Apple Pay/Google Pay 通过 Payment Request API 集成，用户无需手动输入任何信息</li>\n<li>Account Updater 自动同步更新的卡号，减少因卡过期导致的支付失败</li>\n<li>订阅扣款失败率约 5-10%，催收管理（智能重试+宽限期+用户通知）可恢复大部分失败交易</li>\n<li>PSD2/SCA 的 MIT 豁免允许订阅续费免认证，但首次绑卡必须完成强客户认证</li>\n<li>一键支付需平衡便利性与安全性，设备绑定和异常检测是防止账户盗用的关键防线</li>\n</ul>\n","headings":[{"level":1,"text":"一键支付与快捷结账","id":"一键支付与快捷结账"},{"level":2,"text":"核心概念","id":"核心概念"},{"level":2,"text":"支付信息令牌化存储","id":"支付信息令牌化存储"},{"level":2,"text":"Apple Pay 与 Google Pay 集成","id":"apple-pay-与-google-pay-集成"},{"level":2,"text":"订阅与自动扣款","id":"订阅与自动扣款"},{"level":2,"text":"安全与合规约束","id":"安全与合规约束"},{"level":2,"text":"小结","id":"小结"}],"prev":{"title":"购物车放弃与挽回策略","url":"/l-doc-books/h/ecommerce/ecommerce-payments/checkout-optimization/cart-abandonment"},"next":{"title":"支付欺诈检测","url":"/l-doc-books/h/ecommerce/ecommerce-payments/risk-and-fraud/fraud-detection"}}